      "writtenOn": "2022-08-05T10:14:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, ignore that edge case: it seems to be handled because, if an LE connection exists but is not up, `BTM_ReadConnectedTransportAddress()` will modify `other_address2` to be the RPA.",
      "parentUuid": "a1bed99e_22fda7ae",
      "revId": "41a71c8eb20a46e17ba5bdc8d9a1999c1f458016",
